# -*- mode: python ; coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
Optimised single-file spec for LC Analyser.
- Uses targeted hidden-imports instead of collect_all to avoid pulling
  in the entire package tree (docs, tests, locale files, etc.).
- Explicitly excludes heavy packages that are installed globally but
  NOT used by this app (numpy, pandas, PyQt6, streamlit, selenium, etc.).
- Strips debug info and enables UPX for maximum compression.
- Does NOT change any application functionality.
"""

